("What are Denmath’s bouyon riddims?", "His documented bouyon riddims are Tropical Riddim, released in the summer of 2022, and Harley Riddim, released in 2022. He is also credited on Koko Bwa’s Tarif, released in April 2025, with Boutcha Bwa."),
