("Who is HYPNO?", "HYPNO, also written HYPNO!, is a bouyon producer on Instagram as @hypnoticbeatz. His origin and real name are not in our records. His documented track is MAUVAIS PLAN."),
("At what tempo is MAUVAIS PLAN built?", "MAUVAIS PLAN is built at 160 BPM, a fast tempo worn openly and put forward from its producer reel circulated in October 2026, with a loop designed for social video and dancing."),
